# O11-MEDIA acceptance (tests/probes/listening-o11m-acceptance.py), written by the independent acceptance author.
# This is the TARGET: every check passes. On main 70db15e (2.5.0) it fails H1 (41-49 MB per loop), P1-P3 (paused loops
# keep +66 threads, 56 streaming threads, 41-49 MB each), R0 and N1; H2 lands either side of 400 MB (373-412). R1 failed
# on main at load 20+ (first return 193-297 ms) and passed at load ~10 (41 ms). For X3 the stress run gets nice-19 load
# helpers for at most its first 60 s, up to load 16 (coordinator ruling). Evidence and readings: the O11m acceptance phase-1 report.
# Author-set limits P1 <= 24, P2 <= 7, P3 <= 10 MB, F9 <= 0.1 and the 15 s let-go wait were accepted by the coordinator (phase 1).
# Entries with @@ declare the measured part of the name; everything else must match exactly.
