# Coordinator request on 3e937b9. W: the idle warm-up of GDK's download set-up must never touch a preview, a resume
# or two user actions <= 1 s apart (previews clicked through, page switches), runs once, and holds the GTK thread at
# most 500 ms when it runs (limit ruled on 326a4eb). T: late weak-ref notifies (old sinks' tokens, the next sink's
# addresses) must never authorise releasing the GL context of a newer sink still alive.
